		{
			"to": "making/screw-cutting",
			"why": "The tinfoil phonograph's cylinder rode on a shaft cut ten threads to the inch and turning in a nut, a lead screw that carried it one groove along for each turn, as a screw-cutting lathe's lead screw carries its tool one pitch for each turn of the work."
		},
		{
